{"_notes":["Locally added -- upstream pinmame-nvram-maps has no map for Family Guy.","Built from a 4-player game driven through the cabinet's own streamer.","current_player and current_ball are adjacent in CPU RAM at 0x00033AEC and 0x00033AED, player low","Scores are 4 bytes on 8-byte centres from 0x021109E4, the only group the sweep offered.","Five records from 0x02102B60 in the usual 32-byte form, bounded by where the checksum stops","validating. No mode champions: the block ends at five and the post-game DMD cycle showed the","high score ladder only.","Only fg_1200af is claimed; SAM addresses move between revisions.","game_over and credits come from a 1,101-frame recording of live memory spanning an operator-menu","session and a full game. The session also promoted ball_count and max_credits from derived to","measured: menu values 5 and 9 landed at adjustment indices 30 and 32 as the free_play-relative","rule predicted.","game_over at 0x00032E04 reads 5 in attract and 0 in play, dropping at the exact frame the game","started -- the same frame credits fell -- and returning 24 samples after the last score, the","bonus and match sequence. Correct in all 1,101 frames. Any non-zero value is game over, so no","mask is needed. This game does NOT keep the ball+0x31 status byte its siblings use; that byte is","a constant 3 here.","credits at 0x0211100C, the tenth SAM game at that address: rose 1,2,3 with the coins, fell to 2","at game start.","tilted is deliberately absent, and this is a measured conclusion rather than a gap. Three","recordings were made, one with a mid-ball tilt on ball 1 that froze scoring at 770 from f31 to","the drain. The tap was widened until every CPU region had been covered: 0x00000-0x2FFFF,","0x40000-0x7FFFF and 0x80000-0xFFFFF did not change by a single byte across a full game, so","this ROM's entire live RAM is the 64KB block at 0x30000-0x3FFFF, and no byte in it holds one","value through the tilt and a shared other value through normal play -- nor does any 'ball live'","style flag drop at the tilt. The only trace of the tilt is a display event code at 0x00037720","(8 resting, 68 at ball start, 64 at the warning, 20 for the duration of the tilt); it shares","bits with the other events, so no mask isolates it and it is not declared.","2026-11: tilted added: the status byte 0x00033B18 (player + 0x2C; 01 attract, 12 play, 60/79","modes) reads 14 from the tilt to the next ball.","2026-11: Master Volume and the A.1 (63) and A.2 (26) adjustments added from the ROM image","(README, 'Adjustments from the ROM').","Confirmed on a cabinet 2026-11-13 (ALP4K; two players, tilt on P1 ball 1): 455,290 / 504,540,","the records and the status byte matched the DMD; game_over read 05 in attract and 00 in the","game."],"_fileformat":0.9,"_metadata":{"version":10,"license":"Open Data Commons Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0","copyright":["Copyright (C) 2026 by Wes Smith <evilwraith@gmail.com>"],"platform":"stern-sam.6e326d93","roms":["fg_1200af"],"validation":{"checksum":[{"_notes":"89 adjustments: 4-byte LE value, 1-byte checksum, 3 bytes 0xFF padding","label":"Adjustment {#} (checksum)","start":"0x02102008","length":5,"complement":true,"repeat":{"count":89,"step":8}},{"label":"Champion record {#} (checksum)","start":"0x2102B60","repeat":{"count":5,"step":32},"length":30,"bits":16,"complement":true},{"label":"Master Volume","start":"0x0211024C","end":"0x0211024D","complement":true}]},"values":{"no_yes":["NO","YES"],"credit_ticket_token":["CREDIT","TICKET","TOKEN"]}},"checksum8":[{"label":"Free Play adjustment","start":"0x02102110","end":"0x02102114"},{"label":"Balls Per Game adjustment","start":"0x021020F8","end":"0x021020FC"},{"label":"Maximum Credits adjustment","start":"0x02102108","end":"0x0210210C"}],"game_state":{"player_count":{"label":"Player Count","encoding":"int","start":"0x02110900"},"free_play":{"label":"Free Play","encoding":"bool","start":"0x02102110"},"credits":{"label":"Credits","encoding":"int","start":"0x